    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Here, here. I am studying a grammar book right now, but I always have to ask my teacher whether or not a certain piece of grammar is conversational or not. Some kind of Icon or note would be MOST HELPFUL!",
      "html": "Here, here. I am studying a grammar book right now, but I always have to ask my teacher whether or not a certain piece of grammar is conversational or not. Some kind of Icon or note would be MOST HELPFUL!",
