    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Example #3267 belongs in another category. Also, there are two ways of translating つつ on its own.\n\nつつ(1) is close to ながら, but つつ(2)・つつも is similar to 〜ているのに.",
      "html": "Example #3267 belongs in another category. Also, there are two ways of translating つつ on its own.<br/><br/>つつ(1) is close to ながら, but つつ(2)・つつも is similar to 〜ているのに.",
